    "title": ":farmer: `gtest.missing_result` test failing because freezes in `GenericClient.take_response` in Kilted",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/issues/2983",
    "body": "### Generated by Generative AI\n\n_No response_\n\n### Operating System:\n\nUbuntu Noble\n\n### ROS version or commit hash:\n\nKilted Kaiju\n\n### RMW implementation (if applicable):\n\nConnext\n\n### RMW Configuration (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### Client library (if applicable):\n\nrclcpp\n\n### 'ros2 doctor --report' output\n\n<details><summary>ros2 doctor --report</summary>\n\n```console\n<COPY OUTPUT HERE>\n```\n</details>\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce issue\n\n1. Go to https://build.ros2.org/job/Kci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64 in buildfarm\n2. Build the job\n3. See the test failing\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe test to pass without problems\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nTest is reporting a failure\n\n### Additional information\n\n Reference build:\n- [Kci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64#62](http://build.ros2.org/job/Kci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64/62)\n\nTest regression:\n- [rclcpp.test_client_common.gtest.missing_result](https://build.ros2.org/job/Kci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64/62/testReport/junit/(root)/rclcpp/test_client_common_gtest_missing_result/)\n\nLog Output:\n```\n29: [       OK ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.async_send_request_rcl_send_request_error (206 ms)\n29: [ RUN      ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.async_send_request_rcl_service_server_is_available_error\n29: RTI Connext DDS Non-commercial license is for academic, research, evaluation and personal use only. USE FOR COMMERCIAL PURPOSES IS PROHIBITED. See RTI_LICENSE.TXT for terms. Download free tools at rti.com/ncl. License issued to Non-Commercial User license@rti.com For non-production use only.\n29: Expires on 00-jan-00\n29: Please contact support@rti.com with any questions or comments.\n29: [       OK ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.async_send_request_rcl_service_server_is_available_error (206 ms)\n29: [ RUN      ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.take_response\n29: -- run_test.py: return code -11\n29: -- run_test.py: generate result file '/tmp/ws/test_results/rclcpp/test_client_common.gtest.xml' with failed test\n29: -- run_test.py: verify result file '/tmp/ws/test_results/rclcpp/test_client_common.gtest.xml'\n1/1 Test #29: test_client_common ...............***Failed    4.67 sec\n```\n\nFlakyness last 15 days:\n\njob_name|last_fail|first_fail|build_count|failure_count|failure_percentage\n|--|--|--|--|--|--\nKci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64|2025-11-10|2025-11-10|5|1|20.0\n\nThis test have been failing since [Kci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64#39](https://build.ros2.org/job/Kci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64/39) but with a different output in that case\n```\n[       OK ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.async_send_request (206 ms)\n[ RUN      ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.test_client_remove_pending_request\nRTI Connext DDS Non-commercial license is for academic, research, evaluation and personal use only. USE FOR COMMERCIAL PURPOSES IS PROHIBITED. See RTI_LICENSE.TXT for terms. Download free tools at rti.com/ncl. License issued to Non-Commercial User license@rti.com For non-production use only.\nExpires on 00-jan-00\nPlease contact support@rti.com with any questions or comments.\n[       OK ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.test_client_remove_pending_request (206 ms)\n[ RUN      ] TestAllClientTypesWithServer/GenericClient.prune_requests_older_than_no_pruned\n```\n\nThe only change that was introduced to rclcpp from the [first time it happened](https://build.ros2.org/job/Kci__nightly-connext_ubuntu_noble_amd64/39) was: `rmw_connextdds/pull/201`, but it doesn't seem related to the problem, as it was just a fix to calculate the size of a serialized key.\n\nCC: @Crola1702 ",
